Yesterday on @CNBC i discussed three sectors i found more appealing than Technology near-term w/ @TheJudgeCNBC and one of these was #MATERIALS 
@marketsurge Charts: https://t.co/XW54gpkuMU

Given Bessent's doubling of the buyback program this week to provide some cushion to long-dated Treasuries, this fueled some upside acceleration in commodities, Gold and Silver particularly, along with Crypto on liquidity optimism, and the Equal-weighted Materials ETF ($RSPM) has just made a new all-time high.   $XLB

The inability to secure an immediate peace deal in the Gulf does have some bullish consequences for the Materials sector.   Triangle pattern breakouts of this sort are quite technically bullish and likely fuel some acceleration in Metals/mining, Ferts and other parts of Materials.  Happy Friday All.  Charts courtesy of @IBDinvestors 

